    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "This will be a shitty bug report... I am looking for help on how to debug this.\r\n\r\n### Contributing guidelines\r\n\r\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\r\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\r\n\r\n### Module(s)\r\n\r\nmini.pick\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nSometimes I get a red color inside picker elements.\r\n\r\n### Neovim version\r\n\r\nv0.9.5\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nI do not know how to reproduce this, nor how to debug it...\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\n\r\nNo funky highlights\r\n\r\n### Actual behavior\r\n\r\nA slash and an icon is highlighted on redish.\r\n![image](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/11474625/d6cbb351-b3e6-4886-83bb-1f7f0ff677ca)\r\nIt does not always appear, nor it does in the same spots.\r\n\r\nI cannot find a way to debug this, because i cannot navigate inside the picker elements.",
