            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hm... I have not seen this in the wild.\r\n\r\nI'd start with two steps:\r\n- You seem to have some custom setup to update statusline when picker is active. Is it publicly available? Try to  disable it and see.\r\n- Good old config bisecting: comment out all plugins/settings and gradually add half of what is left until you can reproduce this.\r\n\r\nMy initial intuition is that the buffer which picker is displaying got some syntax highlighting enabled (maybe Lua?).",
