            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I think I found it!\r\nThe problem arises when matching parenthesis are highlighted in the previous buffer. The relative position is transported to the picker.\r\n\r\nminimal config:\r\n```lua\r\nlocal lazypath = \"/tmp/lazy/lazy.nvim\"\r\nif not vim.loop.fs_stat(lazypath) then\r\n  vim.fn.system { \"git\", \"clone\", \"--filter=blob:none\", \"https://github.com/folke/lazy.nvim.git\", \"--branch=stable\", lazypath }\r\nend\r\nvim.opt.rtp:prepend(lazypath)\r\nvim.opt.termguicolors = true\r\n\r\nrequire(\"lazy\").setup ({\r\n    {\r\n        \"echasnovski/mini.pick\",\r\n        config = true,\r\n    },\r\n}, { root = \"/tmp/lazy\" })\r\n\r\nvim.cmd.colorscheme(\"habamax\")\r\n```\r\n\r\ntest file:\r\n`test.lua`\r\n```lua\r\n()\r\n```\r\n\r\nopen picker with `:Pick files`, the first icon is colored like the matching parenthesis was:\r\n![image](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/11474625/f598adf5-0eab-420c-ab7c-83380e6132ad)\r\n![image](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/11474625/226b7a64-5ce3-4b5b-b524-8218cc639047)\r\n\r\n\r\nSame test with parenthesis on other lines:\r\n![image](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/11474625/f1fa9078-d139-4c35-84ff-aadd65636d43)\r\n![image](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/11474625/03671400-a8d1-4165-9413-6e576a3c30f6)\r\n\r\n\r\n",
